String and UInt8 have no common type, nor have Decimals of different scales, nor a
Decimal and an integer that no Decimal(38, S) holds: Decimal(38, 20) with Int64 needs
20 + 19 digits. The diagnostic points at the call. The stream query gets DF4501.
-- dynaflux/page_views.sql --
CREATE STREAM page_views (
    user_id     String,
    page        String,
    referrer    Nullable(String),
    tags        Array(String),
    duration_ms UInt32,
    price       Decimal(10, 2),
    rate        Decimal(10, 3),
    ratio       Decimal(38, 20),
    total       Int64
)
PRIMARY KEY (user_id);
-- dynaflux/page_daily.sql --
CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW page_daily
ORDER BY (page, day)
PRIMARY KEY (page)
AS SELECT
    page,
    toStartOfDay(event_time) AS day,
    count()                  AS views,
    uniqExact(user_id)       AS visitors,
    sum(duration_ms)         AS total_ms
FROM page_views
GROUP BY page, day;
-- dynaflux/queries.sql --
-- name: PageLabels :many
SELECT day, if(views > 10, 'busy', 0) AS label
FROM page_daily
WHERE page = {page:String};

-- name: Mixed :many
SELECT if(price > 0, price, rate) AS scales, if(price > 0, ratio, total) AS digits
FROM page_views
WHERE user_id = {user:String};
-- want --
dynaflux/queries.sql:2:13: error DF5308
dynaflux/queries.sql:7:8: error DF5308
dynaflux/queries.sql:7:46: error DF5308
dynaflux/queries.sql:8:6: warning DF4501
-- want-text --
dynaflux/queries.sql:2:13: error DF5308: PageLabels: String and UInt8 have no common type
  hint: for Decimals, use one scale
dynaflux/queries.sql:7:8: error DF5308: Mixed: Decimal(10, 2) and Decimal(10, 3) have no common type
  hint: for Decimals, use one scale
dynaflux/queries.sql:7:46: error DF5308: Mixed: Decimal(38, 20) and Int64 have no common type
  hint: for Decimals, use one scale
dynaflux/queries.sql:8:6: warning DF4501: Mixed: reads stream page_views, which keeps events for 2 DAY after ingestion (LOG RETENTION). Older events are only in the archive.
  hint: query older events with Athena, or aggregate them in a view
